c; the book''s percentage split is in the body. No occ_restrictions. || PRECEDENT: stone-master carries the True Atlantean as a variant and atlantean-monster-hunter as race ''none'' plus a prose section; both predate this race row, and whether they should now point at it is left to the importer."
